\ dispatch_generic_error.1z - Tests error handling for generic words

use "testing" ;

\ Define a generic word with an empty default body
no-default: ( value -- result ) generic [ ] ;

\ Register a method only for integers
no-default: method{ integer } [ 1 + ] ;

\ This should work fine
42 no-default 43 "method works for registered type" assert=

\ But calling with a string (no method registered) should error
\ This test expects an error
"test" no-default
